sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as CPU (M0)
    participant A1 as IP CSR (S1)
    participant A2 as DMA (M1)
    participant A3 as Memory (S0)
    participant A4 as UART
    A0->>A1: SINGLE writes: DST=0x200, LEN=4, CTRL=3
    A1->>A2: START UART-to-memory
    A4->>A2: Receive 4 x 8N1 bytes into RX FIFO
    A2->>A3: HBUSREQ; wait for granted ownership
    A2->>A3: Write INCR4: NONSEQ A0, then 3 x SEQ
    A2->>A3: HWDATA follows its address phase
    A3-->>A2: Wait states; 4 accepted data phases
    A2->>A1: DMA_DONE=1 after final write succeeds
    A0->>A3: SINGLE reads: 0x200, 0x204, 0x208, 0x20C
    A3-->>A0: Verify 4 received bytes in low bits
